WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.030 --> 00:01.540
[Disclaimer: All events depicted in this series are fictional]

3
00:01.560 --> 00:02.370
[and created for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:02.390 --> 00:03.310
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

5
00:21.340 --> 00:23.500
Is there anything we can do for you?

6
00:23.640 --> 00:25.260
All I want is peace.

7
00:25.280 --> 00:26.490
Come daybreak,

8
00:26.510 --> 00:27.880
pack up and leave.

9
00:28.060 --> 00:30.060
I'll finish you off first.

10
00:33.980 --> 00:35.010
Peem...

11
00:35.640 --> 00:37.300
Until the wedding,

12
00:37.420 --> 00:39.490
should I just stop you from taking any more jobs?

13
00:39.900 --> 00:40.970
In this life,

14
00:41.570 --> 00:43.990
I will never let you be torn from the one you love again.

15
00:44.320 --> 00:45.380
And in this life,

16
00:45.700 --> 00:47.280
you won't be lonely,

17
00:47.390 --> 00:49.760
nor will you have to bear the pain alone, either.

18
02:14.100 --> 02:15.410
Get the gates ready.

19
02:15.970 --> 02:17.870
- Hurry. - Come on, everyone!

20
02:26.950 --> 02:28.930
Whoa, now you're switching sides?

21
02:29.050 --> 02:30.490
Well, of course.

22
02:30.510 --> 02:32.720
I might be his number-one disciple,

23
02:33.020 --> 02:35.840
but Khem is my number-one best friend, too.

24
02:36.250 --> 02:38.690
Sorry about this, Master.

25
02:38.710 --> 02:41.850
As Khem's number-one favorite sister,

26
02:41.880 --> 02:44.220
I belong on this side, too.

27
02:44.720 --> 02:46.790
They're going to make you work for it.

28
02:54.780 --> 02:55.440
Alright.

29
02:56.210 --> 02:57.760
What's the first challenge?

30
03:39.060 --> 03:40.270
Master...

31
03:43.350 --> 03:45.480
- Nice. - Down the hatch.

32
03:46.590 --> 03:47.730
- Come on, Master. - Won't you drink it?

33
03:47.750 --> 03:49.570
- Drink up. - It's good. Have a sip.

34
03:49.590 --> 03:52.790
- A little won't hurt, Master. Just for today. - Come on, not even a drop?

35
04:07.300 --> 04:08.830
- You may go through now. - Please.

36
04:08.850 --> 04:10.310
- Step on through. - Please go ahead.

37
04:59.510 --> 05:01.130
- Forty-eight, - Forty-eight,

38
05:01.290 --> 05:02.610
- forty-nine, - forty-nine,

39
05:03.240 --> 05:05.310
- and fifty. - and fifty.

40
05:11.130 --> 05:12.420
Here we go.

41
05:14.370 --> 05:15.300
Get up.

42
05:15.920 --> 05:16.640
Get up, guys.

43
05:28.020 --> 05:29.210
Whoa, Master.

44
05:29.810 --> 05:31.440
The dowry alone is nine million

45
05:32.500 --> 05:33.800
and nine rai of land.

46
05:34.260 --> 05:35.270
That's not even including the gold.

47
05:35.290 --> 05:37.590
With the gold, it's well over ten million.

48
05:37.820 --> 05:38.930
How come we only got this much?

49
05:39.140 --> 05:41.330
Pong, mind your manners, or you'll be in trouble.

50
05:42.340 --> 05:43.830
I guess I'm already in trouble.

51
05:55.020 --> 05:56.090
Thank you.

52
06:13.130 --> 06:15.170
I love my groom more than anything!

53
06:15.270 --> 06:17.290
Sorry? What was that?

54
06:20.000 --> 06:21.910
I love my groom more than anything!

55
06:25.580 --> 06:27.040
How much do you love him?

56
06:28.720 --> 06:30.590
More than anything in the world!

57
06:34.330 --> 06:37.730
And how long will that love last?

58
06:39.670 --> 06:42.000
For all the lifetimes to come.

59
06:42.020 --> 06:44.060
- Whoa. - Wow.

60
06:50.580 --> 06:51.380
Incredible.

61
06:52.970 --> 06:54.310
I love you, too.

62
07:05.120 --> 07:11.130
♪ A blessed day has come, with fortune aglow ♪

63
07:11.160 --> 07:17.210
♪ Graceful offerings are arranged in a row ♪

64
07:17.230 --> 07:21.460
♪ Sacred threads and rings of gold, ♪

65
07:21.480 --> 07:24.360
♪ Jewels and necklaces, precious to behold ♪

66
07:24.380 --> 07:26.600
♪ A feast overflowing with plenty to spare ♪

67
07:26.630 --> 07:29.440
♪ All things prepared with the greatest care ♪

68
07:29.470 --> 07:32.010
♪ Betel rolls and areca nuts are laid there ♪

69
07:32.030 --> 07:35.010
♪ Everything adorned and displayed with flair ♪

70
07:35.030 --> 07:41.080
♪ "May your vital forces come forth" ♪

71
07:41.100 --> 07:45.210
♪ May your vital forces come forth ♪

72
07:45.850 --> 07:49.490
♪ O vital forces, beyond the skies, ♪

73
07:49.520 --> 07:51.730
♪ In distant realms where your souls fly, ♪

74
07:51.750 --> 07:53.550
♪ Heed the call and now arise, ♪

75
07:53.570 --> 08:00.380
♪ Return to where your vessels lie ♪

76
09:04.930 --> 09:07.790
May you stand as steadfast as this stone

77
09:08.020 --> 09:10.120
and as calm as the water washing your feet.

78
09:10.800 --> 09:13.230
May you and Khem love each other for all eternity.

79
09:16.850 --> 09:18.930
The groom may now go upstairs.

80
09:20.180 --> 09:22.810
- Come on, make some noise. - Up you go.

81
09:22.840 --> 09:24.990
- You may go now. - Upstairs, please.

82
09:25.010 --> 09:26.300
Go on up.

83
09:27.990 --> 09:32.430
- Up you go. - Head on up.

84
10:24.650 --> 10:26.110
Guess you'll just end the ceremony here, huh?

85
10:50.310 --> 10:51.980
Peem.

86
10:57.530 --> 11:00.400
[Title Deed]

87
11:00.430 --> 11:05.620
♪ A blessed day has come, with fortune aglow ♪

88
11:05.640 --> 11:10.500
♪ Graceful offerings are arranged in a row ♪

89
11:10.530 --> 11:13.550
♪ Sacred threads and rings of gold, ♪

90
11:13.570 --> 11:16.160
♪ Jewels and necklaces, precious to behold ♪

91
11:16.180 --> 11:17.810
♪ A feast overflowing with plenty to spare ♪

92
11:17.840 --> 11:20.300
♪ All things prepared with the greatest care ♪

93
11:20.330 --> 11:22.470
♪ Betel rolls and areca nuts are laid there ♪

94
11:22.490 --> 11:24.900
♪ Everything adorned and displayed with flair ♪

95
11:24.920 --> 11:34.620
♪ "May your vital forces come forth" ♪

96
11:34.640 --> 11:37.770
- May your vital forces come forth. - May your vital forces come forth.

97
11:38.370 --> 11:41.010
♪ Sweet flowers fill the air with their perfume, ♪

98
11:41.040 --> 11:43.810
♪ Liquor rests upon the sacred tray in the room ♪

99
11:43.830 --> 11:48.040
♪ Eat the banana sticky rice, let offerings bloom ♪

100
11:48.070 --> 11:50.880
♪ With flawless eggs, awaiting the grooms ♪

101
11:50.910 --> 11:57.820
♪ May the groom's vital force return to abide, ♪

102
11:57.840 --> 12:02.840
♪ May his beloved's come forth to be by his side ♪

103
12:02.860 --> 12:05.570
♪ Though you wander in skies far away, ♪

104
12:05.600 --> 12:09.790
♪ Come forth, come here today ♪

105
12:09.900 --> 12:17.210
♪ "May your vital forces come forth" ♪

106
12:17.240 --> 12:18.890
The yolk is perfectly centered.

107
12:19.070 --> 12:20.740
- May your vital forces come forth. - May your vital forces come forth.

108
12:20.770 --> 12:23.200
It means our love will last forever.

109
12:27.710 --> 12:32.280
♪ Receive these new offerings we display ♪

110
12:32.310 --> 12:37.330
♪ And feast on the rice and eggs so you may stay ♪

111
12:37.350 --> 12:39.880
♪ As ancient customs have decreed, they say ♪

112
12:39.910 --> 12:42.460
♪ this blessed day brings fortune your way ♪

113
12:42.490 --> 12:46.370
♪ May you share one bed and together stay ♪

114
12:46.400 --> 12:50.940
♪ Let your lineage thrive and never fade away ♪

115
12:50.960 --> 13:00.010
♪ "May your vital forces come forth" ♪

116
13:00.030 --> 13:03.960
- May your vital forces come forth. - May your vital forces come forth.

117
13:42.440 --> 13:44.840
Wishing you a lifetime of love and happiness.

118
13:45.340 --> 13:47.500
May your years together be long and prosperous.

119
13:47.670 --> 13:49.940
Talk through whatever problems come your way.

120
13:50.320 --> 13:51.910
May you be blessed with joy, prosperity,

121
13:51.930 --> 13:53.120
and a long life.

122
14:14.200 --> 14:15.450
Bro...

123
14:16.600 --> 14:18.220
My bro...

124
14:22.200 --> 14:22.820
Bro...

125
14:22.840 --> 14:24.080
The others are waiting.

126
14:32.770 --> 14:34.130
Love each other for a long time.

127
14:34.460 --> 14:36.900
Wishing you both endless happiness

128
14:37.820 --> 14:41.120
and a love that lasts forever.

129
14:43.630 --> 14:45.330
Congratulations, Khem.

130
14:45.480 --> 14:47.070
I'll be sure to visit often.

131
14:47.090 --> 14:48.370
You're always welcome here.

132
14:57.370 --> 15:02.020
May you two love each other for a long time.

133
15:02.150 --> 15:05.670
May your long be prosperous and years.

134
15:06.350 --> 15:07.530
Sadhu.

135
15:07.560 --> 15:08.700
No need to do that.

136
15:08.730 --> 15:09.570
Oh...

137
15:14.300 --> 15:15.890
- Wishing you both every happiness. - Thank you.

138
15:31.260 --> 15:33.050
You are one family now.

139
15:34.000 --> 15:37.920
I entrust Khem to your care.

140
15:42.520 --> 15:46.400
And Khem, you must take good care of him, too.

141
15:53.110 --> 15:54.520
Thank you, Father.

142
16:09.900 --> 16:13.440
Our ceremony is now complete.

143
16:13.460 --> 16:18.190
Now, let's send our newlyweds off to their wedding chamber!

144
16:33.190 --> 16:42.930
- Kiss him! - Kiss him!

145
16:42.960 --> 16:43.850
- Come on! - Kiss him!

146
16:43.870 --> 16:45.080
- Kiss him, bro. - Kiss him!

147
16:45.380 --> 16:46.160
Kiss him!

148
16:46.180 --> 16:48.260
- Come on, Master. - Kiss him!

149
16:48.290 --> 16:50.070
- Bro! - Kiss him!

150
16:54.600 --> 16:55.260
Kiss him back.

151
16:55.290 --> 17:00.490
- Kiss him back! - Kiss him back!

152
17:00.510 --> 17:02.530
- Khem... - Kiss him, Khem!

153
17:02.930 --> 17:03.790
Do it.

154
17:03.810 --> 17:05.260
- Kiss him, Khem! - Kiss him!

155
17:45.520 --> 17:48.990
Speaking on behalf of Khem's family,

156
17:49.720 --> 17:52.020
please take care of Khem, Master.

157
17:52.580 --> 17:54.550
May you love

158
17:54.570 --> 17:58.030
and cherish him with all your heart.

159
17:58.680 --> 18:02.480
Through thick and thin, always forgive each other.

160
18:02.890 --> 18:05.340
May your love endure for a lifetime.

161
18:07.790 --> 18:09.260
Thank you, Mom.

162
18:09.760 --> 18:12.850
Wishing you a long life and great fortune.

163
18:13.920 --> 18:16.090
May your marriage be peaceful

164
18:16.120 --> 18:17.770
and filled with prosperity.

165
18:18.200 --> 18:19.900
May you love and stay faithful to each other

166
18:20.260 --> 18:23.710
until the very end, Master, Khem.

167
18:25.970 --> 18:27.000
Thank you.

168
18:43.490 --> 18:44.220
Oh...

169
18:44.940 --> 18:45.840
Off you go.

170
18:45.980 --> 18:48.180
Out, out. Everyone out.

171
18:48.200 --> 18:50.420
Leave the newlyweds alone, come on.

172
18:50.450 --> 18:53.430
- Look at them blushing. Go. - Alright.

173
18:53.450 --> 18:54.300
- Okay. - Go on.

174
18:54.330 --> 18:55.240
- Alright. - Out.

175
18:56.080 --> 18:57.310
Give it everything you've got!

176
18:57.370 --> 18:58.090
Move it.

177
19:18.280 --> 19:20.200
These guys, seriously...

178
19:26.290 --> 19:27.460
Are you tired?

179
19:29.450 --> 19:30.300
Yes.

180
19:32.900 --> 19:34.360
But I'm overjoyed.

181
19:41.740 --> 19:43.290
Now that we're in the wedding chamber,

182
19:44.430 --> 19:46.180
what's next?

183
19:52.550 --> 19:53.430
Well...

184
19:59.950 --> 20:01.340
We'll head down to the banquet

185
20:02.430 --> 20:04.700
and then go to the district office.

186
20:07.540 --> 20:10.810
Aren't we meeting the registrar this evening?

187
20:12.170 --> 20:12.960
Yes.

188
20:15.000 --> 20:15.820
But...

189
20:19.500 --> 20:22.080
I want to take your last name right away.

190
20:28.580 --> 20:30.450
Khaekhai would always say

191
20:30.840 --> 20:32.140
this last name

192
20:32.740 --> 20:35.440
was under a curse, bringing misfortune.

193
20:35.780 --> 20:37.920
Now that you won't have to carry it anymore,

194
20:37.960 --> 20:40.600
may you finally be free of all the suffering.

195
20:45.100 --> 20:48.760
Yet it feels like...

196
20:50.480 --> 20:52.630
I have nothing left from Mom.

197
20:54.550 --> 20:56.920
You do. You have yourself.

198
20:59.110 --> 21:03.410
From now on, live a good life and be happy.

199
21:04.260 --> 21:08.160
That is how you cherish what she left behind.

200
21:36.550 --> 21:38.370
Have I told you I love you today?

201
21:39.310 --> 21:40.170
Please.

202
21:42.720 --> 21:45.200
You shouted it across the whole house, Peem.

203
21:48.110 --> 21:48.950
You're right.

204
21:53.840 --> 21:55.250
But not like this.

205
22:05.330 --> 22:06.450
Peem...

206
22:36.800 --> 22:42.700
♪ I'm certain our paths were meant to align ♪

207
22:42.720 --> 22:48.070
♪ Fate brought you here to stand by my side ♪

208
22:48.090 --> 22:53.890
♪ And bound our love to last till the end of time ♪

209
22:53.920 --> 22:57.150
♪ You're the blessing fate bestowed on me, ♪

210
22:57.180 --> 23:00.090
♪ My soulmate for eternity, ♪

211
23:00.120 --> 23:04.110
♪ Forever and endlessly ♪

212
23:04.130 --> 23:10.030
♪ I'm certain our paths were meant to align ♪

213
23:10.050 --> 23:15.380
♪ Fate brought you here to stand by my side ♪

214
23:15.410 --> 23:21.230
♪ And bound our love to last till the end of time ♪

215
23:21.250 --> 23:24.490
♪ You're the blessing fate bestowed on me, ♪

216
23:24.510 --> 23:27.360
♪ My soulmate for eternity, ♪

217
23:27.390 --> 23:31.070
♪ Forever and endlessly ♪

218
24:41.790 --> 24:42.680
What do you think?

219
24:44.720 --> 24:45.780
It looks cute.

220
24:51.460 --> 24:53.170
Let's send Jet a picture.

221
25:07.930 --> 25:09.420
Now that you've sent him a picture,

222
25:10.490 --> 25:11.980
can I take these off now?

223
25:17.280 --> 25:19.000
If you don't like wearing them,

224
25:21.140 --> 25:22.970
you don't have to next time.

225
25:26.320 --> 25:28.110
It's not that I don't want to wear them.

226
25:30.530 --> 25:31.960
What I mean is...

227
25:33.710 --> 25:35.210
Can I get undressed now?

228
25:44.560 --> 25:45.940
Let's play a game.

229
26:06.100 --> 26:07.280
Close your eyes.

230
26:18.330 --> 26:19.340
Peem...

231
26:21.560 --> 26:23.210
While you undress me,

232
26:28.490 --> 26:30.010
try to guess

233
26:32.360 --> 26:33.790
where I put on my perfume.

234
26:34.820 --> 26:36.300
That's where it smells the sweetest.

235
26:40.850 --> 26:41.820
Alright.

236
27:04.930 --> 27:06.140
You can open your eyes.

237
27:17.010 --> 27:18.210
I think...

238
27:20.300 --> 27:21.960
maybe...

239
27:29.500 --> 27:31.010
Not here.

240
27:34.020 --> 27:35.610
Or could it be...

241
27:40.900 --> 27:42.150
This seems like...

242
27:43.750 --> 27:45.170
That's not it.

243
27:52.960 --> 27:54.590
Maybe...

244
28:18.590 --> 28:20.370
Still doesn't seem to be it.

245
28:26.660 --> 28:27.660
Then...

246
28:46.420 --> 28:47.860
Could it be...

247
28:52.260 --> 28:53.430
right here?

248
29:07.110 --> 29:08.140
That's enough.

249
29:09.340 --> 29:10.860
You're driving me crazy.

250
29:10.990 --> 29:12.850
Well, who started it?

251
29:16.670 --> 29:17.850
I'm done playing.

252
29:21.250 --> 29:22.890
Now that I guessed right,

253
29:24.040 --> 29:26.540
what's my reward?

254
29:28.130 --> 29:29.150
Enough.

255
29:36.290 --> 29:37.570
A reward?

256
29:45.550 --> 29:46.900
How about...

257
29:51.920 --> 29:54.600
I find your sweetest spot instead?

258
31:22.870 --> 31:24.240
One pair left.

259
34:27.429 --> 34:33.060
[January 21, 2028, 12th waning day of the 2nd lunar month, Year of the Goat]

260
38:15.940 --> 38:19.960
[Marriage Certificate]

261
38:31.160 --> 38:33.410
After everything we've been through,

262
38:35.590 --> 38:36.590
at long last,

263
38:37.980 --> 38:40.190
we're finally one family.

264
38:45.420 --> 38:46.690
From now on,

265
38:47.420 --> 38:49.870
I'll be the best husband I can be.

266
38:58.560 --> 39:00.390
I love you more than anything, Khem.

267
39:05.770 --> 39:07.220
I love you, too.

268
39:09.950 --> 39:11.710
More than anything in the world.

269
39:15.020 --> 39:16.330
From this moment on,

270
39:17.490 --> 39:20.090
nothing will ever tear us apart again,

271
39:22.320 --> 39:23.710
my beloved husband.

272
40:11.780 --> 40:14.320
Jet is really dedicated to his work, Mom.

273
40:15.230 --> 40:16.410
He's grown up so much.

274
40:21.360 --> 40:22.810
Is something the matter?

275
40:23.230 --> 40:24.590
You seem troubled.

276
40:28.670 --> 40:30.200
It's good that he's trying,

277
40:31.500 --> 40:33.200
but I haven't seen him smile once.

278
40:36.060 --> 40:38.330
Ugh, these look so bad.

279
40:39.260 --> 40:41.410
I wonder if he's even happy.

280
40:42.490 --> 40:44.720
Come on, things are tough for me, too.

281
40:44.900 --> 40:46.550
I'm not trying to rip you off here.

282
40:46.570 --> 40:47.690
How is this not a rip-off?

283
40:48.110 --> 40:50.370
These are durians, not weeds.

284
40:50.830 --> 40:52.920
Look, let me explain.

285
40:53.130 --> 40:55.500
The other packing houses are offering the same price.

286
40:56.430 --> 40:58.720
If I don't take them, nobody else will, either.

287
40:58.830 --> 41:01.310
And then they'll just rot on the trees.

288
41:03.610 --> 41:05.190
Then don't buy them.

289
41:07.130 --> 41:09.820
What other packing houses pay is none of my business.

290
41:10.300 --> 41:12.580
My parents tended this orchard with great care.

291
41:12.800 --> 41:15.130
We don't need to push unripe durians like the rest of them.

292
41:15.510 --> 41:17.280
Take it or leave it.

293
41:18.240 --> 41:21.130
Hold on, ma'am. Wait.

294
41:22.970 --> 41:25.740
You really haven't lost your edge, Madam Jomkaew.

295
41:42.710 --> 41:44.270
I'll take the whole lot, ma'am.

296
41:46.460 --> 41:48.280
That's how you put your foot down.

297
41:48.310 --> 41:50.100
Don't let anyone lowball you.

298
41:54.840 --> 41:55.840
Hey, Jet.

299
41:56.950 --> 41:58.270
I wasn't scolding you.

300
41:58.710 --> 41:59.870
I was teaching you.

301
42:00.440 --> 42:02.050
That's not why I'm upset, Mom.

302
42:05.720 --> 42:06.590
Then what is it?

303
42:08.400 --> 42:10.430
I wanna get better, too.

304
42:15.170 --> 42:17.020
Khem's married now,

305
42:17.850 --> 42:19.860
and Charn's about to open his hotel.

306
42:22.190 --> 42:25.750
But with this orchard, I don't even know if I can make it work.

307
42:30.610 --> 42:32.100
Aren't you being too hard on yourself?

308
42:34.140 --> 42:37.400
You don't need to be good at everything, Jet.

309
42:38.520 --> 42:41.520
If you can handle it, do it. If you can't, then don't.

310
42:43.210 --> 42:45.130
Grandpa wrote that in his will, didn't he?

311
42:46.370 --> 42:49.550
If you don't want it, you can always sell it off.

312
42:54.010 --> 42:54.710
But...

313
42:55.490 --> 42:57.960
even if I do, I have no idea what I'd do next.

314
43:02.790 --> 43:03.800
I'll tell you what.

315
43:04.930 --> 43:08.040
School isn't that busy right now.

316
43:08.700 --> 43:10.720
I can look after the orchard for a month.

317
43:13.680 --> 43:17.130
Whatever you want to do, make some time for it.

318
43:18.780 --> 43:20.040
Really, Mom?

319
43:22.800 --> 43:25.990
Find out for yourself what it is you want to do.

320
43:43.670 --> 43:44.490
Mom...

321
43:45.390 --> 43:46.190
In that case...

322
43:46.580 --> 43:48.710
would it be okay if I stayed in Bangkok with Charn

323
43:48.740 --> 43:50.420
for about a month?

324
43:57.730 --> 43:59.080
Making time, huh?

325
44:07.130 --> 44:08.450
Goodbye, Master.

326
44:11.850 --> 44:13.150
See you in a month.

327
44:14.180 --> 44:16.680
Take good care of each other, Jet, Charn.

328
44:17.710 --> 44:20.590
If you have time, you two should drop by.

329
44:21.080 --> 44:23.020
I have rooms ready for guests now.

330
44:23.610 --> 44:26.160
Jet and I are staying at the hotel anyway.

331
44:30.840 --> 44:31.830
Give me a hug.

332
44:36.320 --> 44:37.440
I'll see you later.

333
44:38.800 --> 44:39.540
Go on.

334
44:42.040 --> 44:43.180
Let's go to Bangkok!

335
44:44.460 --> 44:45.770
- See you. - See you.

336
44:47.630 --> 44:48.420
Let's go.

337
44:52.770 --> 44:53.620
Thank you.

338
44:53.640 --> 44:57.780
[GP 2543 Ubon Ratchathani]

339
45:15.620 --> 45:17.970
Mint and Praemai were telling me

340
45:19.110 --> 45:20.520
Charn is completely swamped.

341
45:21.740 --> 45:25.260
He's living in Bangkok, but he barely has time to see his friends.

342
45:27.050 --> 45:29.620
And with Jet going to stay with him,

343
45:31.010 --> 45:32.370
I wonder how that'll go.

344
45:38.520 --> 45:39.970
For them to work out,

345
45:40.660 --> 45:42.230
they need to grow at the same pace.

346
45:46.190 --> 45:47.360
I just hope

347
45:48.060 --> 45:50.610
seeing Charn work

348
45:52.450 --> 45:55.730
might motivate Jet to find his own path.

349
46:12.440 --> 46:13.120
[Bangkok]

350
46:13.150 --> 46:15.680
How's the grand opening coming along?

351
46:15.720 --> 46:17.410
Are you ready, Jet?

352
46:17.660 --> 46:19.210
Have you got your suit sorted out?

353
46:19.230 --> 46:20.820
It's only two weeks away.

354
46:22.630 --> 46:24.750
Well, the deluxe wing

355
46:24.780 --> 46:27.670
needs nearly all its plumbing redone,

356
46:27.960 --> 46:30.550
so I think we might have to postpone the opening

357
46:30.580 --> 46:32.620
to early March for a new auspicious date.

358
46:34.660 --> 46:37.120
Whoa, March?

359
46:39.230 --> 46:40.560
You'll be swamped for ages, then.

360
46:42.250 --> 46:43.590
I'm sorry, Jet.

361
46:44.510 --> 46:46.660
I promised you

362
46:46.680 --> 46:50.460
we'd take a trip together after the opening.

363
46:56.120 --> 46:57.830
Don't worry about it, man...

364
47:01.580 --> 47:03.970
I'm totally fine. It's chill.

365
47:05.170 --> 47:06.510
How about this, then?

366
47:06.540 --> 47:09.310
You can stay as my test guest, Jet.

367
47:09.330 --> 47:12.210
Stay here like a real guest.

368
47:12.240 --> 47:13.390
That way, you can give me feedback

369
47:13.410 --> 47:16.420
before the official opening. How does that sound?

370
47:16.840 --> 47:18.160
Sounds great, Mom.

371
47:19.950 --> 47:21.620
Don't worry about me getting lonely, babe.

372
47:23.010 --> 47:25.980
I'm not used to you being so polite.

373
47:48.690 --> 47:49.480
So...

374
47:50.150 --> 47:53.490
was Charn's mom the other woman?

375
47:53.830 --> 47:55.430
Yeah, she was.

376
47:55.500 --> 47:57.710
Once she found out his dad already had a family,

377
47:57.920 --> 48:00.540
she cut him off and raised Charn on her own.

378
48:02.080 --> 48:05.670
His grandpa used to send them money,

379
48:06.160 --> 48:07.750
but when his dad passed away,

380
48:08.030 --> 48:10.330
she gave all of it back to help with the funeral.

381
48:10.650 --> 48:12.240
She never touched a single baht of it.

382
48:12.850 --> 48:14.440
Ms. Ya is amazing,

383
48:14.910 --> 48:16.860
raising a son on her own like that.

384
48:17.000 --> 48:19.660
Yeah, and CKP Hotel

385
48:19.680 --> 48:22.410
comes from her last name, Charoenkiatpreecha.

386
48:22.760 --> 48:24.160
After his dad passed away,

387
48:24.440 --> 48:27.070
Charn took his mom's last name right away.

388
48:27.510 --> 48:30.470
Look at you, knowing so much.

389
48:30.520 --> 48:32.270
You're practically his family now.

390
48:33.250 --> 48:34.310
What are you talking about?

391
48:34.890 --> 48:38.710
Still, it's a relief that she's okay with me.

392
48:40.310 --> 48:41.190
How do I look?

393
48:41.840 --> 48:42.870
Handsome?

394
48:43.490 --> 48:46.290
I've got a date with Charn at seven.

395
48:47.790 --> 48:48.650
What do you think?

396
48:48.670 --> 48:51.090
Aw, going on dates now?

397
48:51.120 --> 48:52.730
Tell me all about the date later.

398
48:52.750 --> 48:53.690
See you.

399
49:23.160 --> 49:24.530
Let's go, Charn. I'm...

400
49:25.400 --> 49:28.830
Well, the contractor and the interior designer

401
49:28.860 --> 49:29.910
got into an argument,

402
49:29.930 --> 49:31.390
so Charn had to sort it out.

403
49:31.420 --> 49:32.650
Seeing how busy he was,

404
49:32.680 --> 49:35.050
I came to see you first.

405
49:37.570 --> 49:38.660
That's alright.

406
49:39.950 --> 49:41.120
Well then...

407
49:42.010 --> 49:43.340
How about we go on a date?

408
49:44.140 --> 49:45.740
You and me?

409
49:45.760 --> 49:47.000
Yes, let's go.

410
49:48.860 --> 49:51.760
I heard you studied art, right?

411
49:52.070 --> 49:54.280
Could you look over some artwork for me?

412
49:54.310 --> 49:55.120
Of course.

413
50:15.240 --> 50:16.200
Sorry about that.

414
50:16.780 --> 50:18.280
I got held up with the event organizers.

415
50:18.790 --> 50:21.690
None of the mood boards they pitched felt right.

416
50:23.220 --> 50:23.850
Wait,

417
50:25.200 --> 50:28.280
isn't your mom handling the event herself?

418
50:28.700 --> 50:30.340
You're only supposed to get the hotel ready.

419
50:31.650 --> 50:35.420
Her assistant was still going for that Chon Buri vibe,

420
50:36.160 --> 50:38.040
so none of the concepts felt right at all.

421
50:38.880 --> 50:41.600
But they've worked together for years.

422
50:42.070 --> 50:44.050
Why don't you let them handle it on their own?

423
50:47.300 --> 50:49.350
You don't need to wear yourself out doing everything.

424
50:50.540 --> 50:51.980
That's what I do at the orchard.

425
50:52.000 --> 50:53.110
I get that,

426
50:54.040 --> 50:56.010
but building a new hotel starts from scratch.

427
50:56.030 --> 50:57.330
There are countless details.

428
50:57.530 --> 51:00.150
It's not the same as running an orchard

429
51:00.170 --> 51:01.410
where you already have experienced workers.

430
51:21.310 --> 51:24.020
I know he didn't mean it.

431
51:24.890 --> 51:26.990
He must've been stressed and exhausted.

432
51:27.010 --> 51:28.000
[Jet]

433
51:28.030 --> 51:29.780
And he was actually right.

434
51:30.710 --> 51:32.010
I didn't even know what to say.

435
51:32.250 --> 51:33.420
Come on.

436
51:34.030 --> 51:37.430
Charn only said that 'cause he thought you'd understand.

437
51:38.420 --> 51:39.930
I doubt he was trying to take a dig at you.

438
51:40.280 --> 51:43.230
If I hadn't understood, I would've lost it.

439
51:43.740 --> 51:45.760
But I have my limits, too, you know.

440
52:00.800 --> 52:02.750
You should clear things up with him.

441
52:04.420 --> 52:05.750
Keeping it bottled up

442
52:06.710 --> 52:07.890
will only make it harder to fix.

443
52:08.460 --> 52:09.380
Khem,

444
52:09.920 --> 52:11.570
every time I wake up, he's already gone.

445
52:12.030 --> 52:13.650
When I go to sleep, he's still not back.

446
52:14.300 --> 52:16.930
During meals, he runs off to put out fires.

447
52:17.530 --> 52:19.350
When am I supposed to clear things up with him?

448
52:20.540 --> 52:21.620
Are you alright?

449
52:22.560 --> 52:23.590
Master?

450
52:24.000 --> 52:24.970
Hello.

451
52:25.970 --> 52:28.590
Honestly, not really.

452
52:29.370 --> 52:30.780
If you're lonely, come back.

453
52:32.110 --> 52:33.890
There's plenty of work waiting for you here.

454
52:35.920 --> 52:37.250
You can work with me.

455
52:38.190 --> 52:39.590
If you're looking for a new job,

456
52:40.100 --> 52:41.620
you can do that from anywhere.

457
52:44.660 --> 52:45.840
Hello?

458
52:45.970 --> 52:47.650
Hello? Sorry?

459
52:48.400 --> 52:49.700
Looks like the connection's bad.

460
52:49.720 --> 52:51.730
Talk to you later, Master. Bye, Khem.

461
53:19.760 --> 53:23.390
[Jettana, Charnvit]

462
53:25.020 --> 53:28.430
[Khem: I hope you can talk things out with Charn.]

463
53:50.680 --> 53:51.700
[You're alone again?] [Yeah, I'm so lonely I'm talking to the walls.]

464
53:51.720 --> 53:52.570
[Call me, then.] [Are you okay, Jet?]

465
53:52.600 --> 53:53.210
[Yeah.] [I hope you can talk things out with Charn.]

466
53:54.520 --> 53:56.330
Jet seems really stressed this time.

467
53:59.450 --> 54:00.820
Growing apart

468
54:02.620 --> 54:03.980
is worse than fighting.

469
54:13.190 --> 54:14.760
I'm scared, Peem.

470
54:18.650 --> 54:20.470
It's always been the four of us.

471
54:21.390 --> 54:23.450
What if those two...

472
54:23.990 --> 54:24.750
They won't.

473
54:29.730 --> 54:31.070
They love each other so much.

474
54:34.510 --> 54:36.550
They won't give up on each other that easily.

475
55:57.200 --> 55:59.190
Your mom asked me to design that brochure.

476
55:59.220 --> 56:00.670
Does it look good?

477
56:03.230 --> 56:04.840
Did I wake you up?

478
56:06.170 --> 56:06.930
No.

479
56:07.460 --> 56:09.210
I've been awake for a while,

480
56:09.630 --> 56:10.880
waiting to eat with you.

481
56:13.370 --> 56:15.540
Go take a shower, then let's order food.

482
56:16.270 --> 56:17.020
Jet...

483
56:17.780 --> 56:20.120
I'm sorry, but I already ate.

484
56:21.450 --> 56:22.990
I had to test the room service.

485
56:23.550 --> 56:25.040
I didn't think you'd wait for me.

486
56:25.690 --> 56:26.950
Want me to order something for you?

487
56:26.980 --> 56:28.460
- I'll do it right now. - It's okay.

488
56:30.880 --> 56:33.720
Just take a shower and let's cuddle in bed.

489
56:33.960 --> 56:36.000
I'm not that hungry anyway.

490
56:40.450 --> 56:41.370
Take off your glasses.

491
57:12.470 --> 57:13.840
Please don't be upset.

492
57:17.060 --> 57:21.620
Once things settle down, I'll make it up to you.

493
57:30.960 --> 57:32.090
Will things ever settle down?

494
57:38.400 --> 57:40.630
Once this project wraps, you'll have another lined up.

495
57:42.890 --> 57:45.110
When will you ever have time for me, Charn?

496
57:46.670 --> 57:47.690
I will soon.

497
57:48.480 --> 57:49.830
Once this branch is done,

498
57:50.050 --> 57:52.140
the rest should be easier.

499
57:54.720 --> 57:57.230
As easy as taking over an orchard?

500
58:01.480 --> 58:03.210
You really are upset over what I said.

501
58:05.010 --> 58:06.090
I'm sorry.

502
58:12.100 --> 58:13.240
Let's go to sleep.

503
58:14.510 --> 58:16.420
We can talk tomorrow once we've cooled off.

504
58:16.920 --> 58:18.400
Things might work out better then.

505
58:20.240 --> 58:21.080
Whoa...

506
58:22.610 --> 58:26.120
If this were work, you'd deal with it right away.

507
58:28.360 --> 58:31.160
But when it comes to my feelings,

508
58:31.710 --> 58:33.160
you're so quick to put them off.

509
58:36.430 --> 58:37.810
That's not it, Jet.

510
58:39.220 --> 58:41.040
I just don't want us to fight.

511
58:43.300 --> 58:44.050
Right.

512
58:45.010 --> 58:46.280
Go take a shower.

513
58:48.420 --> 58:49.930
You've worked all day.

514
58:50.160 --> 58:52.600
You must be more tired than I am since I haven't done anything.

515
59:37.780 --> 59:43.990
[Jettana, Charnvit]

516
01:01:50.470 --> 01:01:53.760
My hubby's cooking gets better every day.

517
01:01:57.830 --> 01:01:59.650
Today's meal is especially tasty.

518
01:02:01.310 --> 01:02:03.000
It's not just my cooking.

519
01:02:03.560 --> 01:02:06.640
I added Cook & Lobster Fish Sauce, too.

520
01:02:07.340 --> 01:02:09.590
That's what gives it that deep, savory flavor

521
01:02:09.860 --> 01:02:12.060
without being too salty, making it tasty.

522
01:02:12.750 --> 01:02:13.840
It really is tasty.

523
01:02:15.440 --> 01:02:17.040
If we hadn't run out of sticky rice,

524
01:02:17.340 --> 01:02:18.740
I would've asked for another bowl.

525
01:02:19.920 --> 01:02:21.020
Look at you.

526
01:02:21.500 --> 01:02:23.170
Are you still not full?

527
01:02:23.740 --> 01:02:26.140
Should I bring you dessert?

528
01:02:46.040 --> 01:02:46.810
No need.

529
01:02:47.450 --> 01:02:48.840
I've got my dessert right here.

530
01:02:55.920 --> 01:02:57.520
Hey, Peem.

531
01:02:58.210 --> 01:02:59.350
What are you doing?

532
01:03:00.810 --> 01:03:02.070
If the cook gets to carry his lobster,

533
01:03:02.700 --> 01:03:04.110
I'd love to carry my love-ster, too.

534
01:03:06.290 --> 01:03:07.210
Peem...

535
01:03:08.440 --> 01:03:09.400
No.

536
01:03:10.770 --> 01:03:12.250
You can't do that!

537
01:03:21.710 --> 01:03:22.450
Jet?

538
01:04:07.940 --> 01:04:08.910
Jet,

539
01:04:09.110 --> 01:04:10.510
your tailored suit is ready.

540
01:04:10.540 --> 01:04:11.720
I picked it up just now.

541
01:04:37.320 --> 01:04:39.330
I need some time to clear my head.

542
01:04:39.930 --> 01:04:41.220
Don't try to contact me.

543
01:04:42.110 --> 01:04:45.050
Once I'm okay, I'll reach out to you.

544
01:04:45.520 --> 01:04:47.000
Sorry for being selfish.

545
01:04:55.230 --> 01:04:57.570
[Babe]

546
01:05:52.250 --> 01:05:56.150
Charn, the smoke detector suddenly went off.

547
01:05:57.920 --> 01:06:00.520
Okay, Mom. I'll be right there.

548
01:06:12.530 --> 01:06:16.850
The number you have dialed cannot be reached.

549
01:06:30.870 --> 01:06:35.440
[Jettana, Charnvit]

550
01:06:36.530 --> 01:06:40.470
[Ubon Ratchathani, March 2028]

551
01:06:46.500 --> 01:06:47.960
This batch is a bit pricey, Uncle,

552
01:06:48.140 --> 01:06:50.360
but I guarantee every single one is full of flesh.

553
01:06:50.380 --> 01:06:51.750
Thank you so much.

554
01:06:51.930 --> 01:06:52.750
Goodbye.

555
01:06:55.880 --> 01:06:57.120
- Take care. - Thanks a lot.

556
01:06:57.150 --> 01:06:58.510
- All set. - Thanks so much.

557
01:06:58.540 --> 01:06:59.450
Thank you.

558
01:07:24.550 --> 01:07:27.920
Seeing you smile puts my mind at ease.

559
01:07:30.090 --> 01:07:31.850
Have you made up your mind yet?

560
01:07:33.240 --> 01:07:36.000
I don't think I'm gonna sell this orchard anymore.

561
01:07:38.750 --> 01:07:41.260
I may not know what I want yet,

562
01:07:42.140 --> 01:07:44.520
but I won't be so hard on myself anymore.

563
01:07:50.450 --> 01:07:51.920
That's the spirit.

564
01:07:52.920 --> 01:07:56.070
I feel a lot better seeing you like this.

565
01:08:00.390 --> 01:08:01.640
And about that other matter,

566
01:08:03.440 --> 01:08:05.130
what have you decided?

567
01:08:06.610 --> 01:08:07.650
What matter?

568
01:08:09.400 --> 01:08:13.030
Are you coming to the States with us,

569
01:08:13.700 --> 01:08:16.350
or are you going to stay at Charn's hotel?

570
01:08:36.660 --> 01:08:48.060
[Bae]

571
01:09:28.560 --> 01:09:30.000
What are you going to do?

572
01:09:34.740 --> 01:09:35.770
It's tomorrow already.

573
01:09:38.250 --> 01:09:39.229
My family already booked the tickets,

574
01:09:39.260 --> 01:09:41.170
and my bags are all packed.

575
01:09:42.300 --> 01:09:43.850
There's nothing I can do now.

576
01:09:54.860 --> 01:09:57.040
[Bae (22)]

577
01:10:02.120 --> 01:10:03.880
Are you really that mad at him?

578
01:10:07.020 --> 01:10:08.930
At first, I was only upset.

579
01:10:10.420 --> 01:10:13.550
But now, we can't even face each other.

580
01:10:15.540 --> 01:10:17.730
I really did try, but...

581
01:10:20.060 --> 01:10:21.350
in the end,

582
01:10:21.940 --> 01:10:24.220
I guess his work will always come before me.

583
01:10:37.060 --> 01:10:42.190
[J3T Ubon Ratchathani 108]

584
01:10:59.300 --> 01:11:00.550
Listen to me.

585
01:11:05.080 --> 01:11:07.210
Every time I had to be away from Khem...

586
01:11:12.370 --> 01:11:13.520
do you think...

587
01:11:15.750 --> 01:11:17.290
I didn't miss him at all?

588
01:11:19.380 --> 01:11:22.040
All I could do was finish the job as fast as I could,

589
01:11:24.610 --> 01:11:26.450
so I could get back to him.

590
01:11:32.790 --> 01:11:35.000
I never once meant to neglect him.

591
01:11:49.650 --> 01:11:51.820
Maybe that's how Charn feels, too.

592
01:12:03.420 --> 01:12:04.230
Khem...

593
01:12:05.350 --> 01:12:06.360
What's wrong?

594
01:12:14.260 --> 01:12:15.160
I...

595
01:12:26.000 --> 01:12:27.260
I'm sorry, Jet.

596
01:12:31.600 --> 01:12:33.440
I really do understand how you feel.

597
01:12:37.590 --> 01:12:38.680
But honestly...

598
01:12:43.570 --> 01:12:46.300
when I think about how things might never be the same

599
01:12:49.260 --> 01:12:50.880
for the four of us,

600
01:12:54.820 --> 01:12:56.200
it breaks my heart.

601
01:13:17.060 --> 01:13:19.170
We've been through so much together.

602
01:13:24.970 --> 01:13:27.040
Charn never had to be here,

603
01:13:29.620 --> 01:13:31.260
yet he chose to put himself through all of it...

604
01:13:35.750 --> 01:13:38.080
never asking why, even when he knew nothing,

605
01:13:44.260 --> 01:13:45.550
because he wanted to be there

606
01:13:45.580 --> 01:13:47.150
to protect us.

607
01:13:49.550 --> 01:13:51.130
He wanted to become Master's disciple,

608
01:13:52.700 --> 01:13:56.940
even though he never believed in any of this.

609
01:14:00.770 --> 01:14:02.760
All he wanted was to be with us.

610
01:14:05.540 --> 01:14:08.530
He was ready to risk his life and jump off that bridge with you...

611
01:14:14.080 --> 01:14:16.140
because he loves you and cares about you.

612
01:14:28.830 --> 01:14:29.940
Do you realize, Jet?

613
01:14:33.700 --> 01:14:35.070
You're the reason we smile

614
01:14:37.040 --> 01:14:39.160
and the source of happiness for all of us.

615
01:14:47.990 --> 01:14:49.490
If you two break up,

616
01:14:53.050 --> 01:14:54.780
do you think Charn could ever smile again?

617
01:15:00.310 --> 01:15:02.070
And would you be happy?

618
01:15:05.540 --> 01:15:08.070
Is this really what will make you happy?

619
01:15:36.660 --> 01:15:39.310
I can't ask you to forgive him.

620
01:15:44.540 --> 01:15:45.740
But at the very least,

621
01:15:48.150 --> 01:15:49.480
if something's come between you,

622
01:15:52.340 --> 01:15:54.250
try to talk things out first.

623
01:16:00.370 --> 01:16:01.960
Don't just drift apart like this.

624
01:16:18.340 --> 01:16:21.450
The number you have dialed cannot be reached...

625
01:16:23.950 --> 01:16:28.390
[Babe (22)]

626
01:17:00.330 --> 01:17:01.460
Charn...

627
01:17:02.310 --> 01:17:03.260
What's wrong?

628
01:17:03.770 --> 01:17:05.750
Still can't reach Jet?

629
01:17:06.580 --> 01:17:07.960
Yes, Mom.

630
01:17:08.650 --> 01:17:10.350
You've been wanting to see him, haven't you?

631
01:17:14.460 --> 01:17:15.670
Every single day.

632
01:17:20.050 --> 01:17:23.630
But things haven't settled down yet.

633
01:17:25.150 --> 01:17:27.090
There's still so much I need to take care of.

634
01:17:31.000 --> 01:17:32.120
It's alright.

635
01:17:32.740 --> 01:17:36.570
I have all the help I need with the hotel.

636
01:17:37.470 --> 01:17:38.990
But when it comes to Jet,

637
01:17:39.400 --> 01:17:41.650
that has to be you.

638
01:17:43.450 --> 01:17:45.100
Khem mentioned

639
01:17:45.470 --> 01:17:47.630
that Jet is leaving for the States tonight.

640
01:17:49.690 --> 01:17:53.020
If you don't talk to him, you might lose him.

641
01:17:57.520 --> 01:17:58.520
Go, okay?

642
01:18:00.440 --> 01:18:02.100
My son's happiness

643
01:18:03.280 --> 01:18:05.560
means so much more than this hotel.

644
01:18:20.710 --> 01:18:21.610
Charn,

645
01:18:22.530 --> 01:18:23.560
you should go now.

646
01:18:25.690 --> 01:18:26.580
Okay...

647
01:18:26.610 --> 01:18:27.930
Okay, Mom.

648
01:18:40.880 --> 01:18:54.330
[Grandpa Phaew's Durian Orchard]

649
01:19:01.490 --> 01:19:02.670
Am I too late?

650
01:20:10.220 --> 01:20:14.850
[Grandpa Phaew's Durian Orchard]

651
01:20:16.760 --> 01:20:17.750
Hey, Charn.

652
01:20:17.940 --> 01:20:20.070
Where are you? I'm already here.

653
01:20:20.770 --> 01:20:22.060
Are you at the airport?

654
01:20:22.740 --> 01:20:23.940
Did I miss you?

655
01:20:24.580 --> 01:20:25.810
Don't get on that plane.

656
01:20:25.970 --> 01:20:27.530
I'll rush straight to you.

657
01:20:27.640 --> 01:20:28.790
Please wait for me.

658
01:20:28.900 --> 01:20:30.650
What? What airport?

659
01:20:31.980 --> 01:20:33.460
I'm here at your hotel.

660
01:20:38.200 --> 01:20:39.510
You're there to see me?

661
01:20:40.760 --> 01:20:42.950
I'm here at the orchard to apologize to you.

662
01:20:46.320 --> 01:20:47.150
Really?

663
01:20:47.760 --> 01:20:50.660
But your mom's hotel opening is tomorrow.

664
01:20:52.390 --> 01:20:53.980
How could I just do nothing?

665
01:20:55.650 --> 01:20:57.690
You were leaving for the States, weren't you?

666
01:21:00.210 --> 01:21:01.550
How could I even leave?

667
01:21:03.130 --> 01:21:04.240
My heart is still with you.

668
01:21:15.900 --> 01:21:17.060
Mine, too.

669
01:21:24.530 --> 01:21:26.060
I choose you, Jet.

670
01:21:27.870 --> 01:21:30.240
There's so much I want to tell you.

671
01:21:32.910 --> 01:21:34.130
Please wait for me.

672
01:21:35.140 --> 01:21:37.470
I'm going to make it up to you in person.

673
01:21:40.730 --> 01:21:41.520
Okay.

674
01:22:10.150 --> 01:22:11.680
You're testing me again?

675
01:22:24.580 --> 01:22:26.160
My sense never fails.

676
01:22:46.690 --> 01:22:48.840
Mas... Master?

677
01:22:51.650 --> 01:22:52.640
Charn...

678
01:23:11.270 --> 01:23:12.040
I...

679
01:23:12.930 --> 01:23:14.340
want to propose to you.

680
01:23:15.360 --> 01:23:17.620
Jet, I should be the one proposing to you.

681
01:23:18.400 --> 01:23:20.130
I'm done waiting.

682
01:23:20.260 --> 01:23:22.230
I don't wanna be away from you again.

683
01:23:26.020 --> 01:23:28.400
I'm sorry, Jet.

684
01:23:29.830 --> 01:23:31.890
I'm sorry for making you feel neglected,

685
01:23:32.930 --> 01:23:34.430
for hurting you,

686
01:23:37.050 --> 01:23:39.820
and for managing my time so poorly.

687
01:23:40.100 --> 01:23:43.040
I failed to balance my life and left you lonely.

688
01:23:43.640 --> 01:23:45.240
I'm sorry for everything.

689
01:23:48.340 --> 01:23:49.750
I should be the one apologizing.

690
01:23:50.810 --> 01:23:52.330
You were so busy with work,

691
01:23:53.410 --> 01:23:56.300
yet I kept expecting you to put me first.

692
01:23:57.130 --> 01:24:00.630
Sometimes, I felt like I took you for granted.

693
01:24:04.200 --> 01:24:05.840
After all the harsh things I said,

694
01:24:07.670 --> 01:24:09.650
you never once asked me to change.

695
01:24:10.990 --> 01:24:12.640
It's because I love you, Jet.

696
01:24:13.130 --> 01:24:14.920
I love you the way you are.

697
01:24:15.340 --> 01:24:16.220
That's all.

698
01:24:19.310 --> 01:24:21.750
Jet, please don't break up with me.

699
01:24:24.740 --> 01:24:26.990
I love you so much. There's no way we're breaking up.

700
01:24:36.750 --> 01:24:38.160
Will you marry me, Charn?

701
01:24:43.500 --> 01:24:45.630
I'm not letting you go again, either.

702
01:25:07.010 --> 01:25:12.040
♪ Without you, I don't know what I should do ♪

703
01:25:12.060 --> 01:25:15.830
♪ I need to know if you still love me too ♪

704
01:25:15.990 --> 01:25:20.570
♪ Just tell me that your love is still true ♪

705
01:25:20.590 --> 01:25:23.990
♪ And that you'll stay till our time is through ♪

706
01:25:24.020 --> 01:25:27.970
♪ Without you, it feels like my heart's gone astray ♪

707
01:25:27.990 --> 01:25:34.340
♪ Tell me the love we shared still means something today ♪

708
01:25:34.370 --> 01:25:38.930
♪ Please don't leave me drowning in tears this way ♪

709
01:25:41.320 --> 01:25:42.660
Did you get that kiss from him?

710
01:25:46.370 --> 01:25:47.920
Then you need another one from me.

711
01:26:05.780 --> 01:26:06.550
Let's go.

712
01:27:18.950 --> 01:27:20.050
Grandma Si?

713
01:27:24.220 --> 01:27:25.330
Grandma Si...

714
01:27:27.730 --> 01:27:29.480
I missed you so much.

715
01:27:47.730 --> 01:27:48.860
What is this?

716
01:28:08.940 --> 01:28:09.910
Grandma Si?

717
01:28:13.870 --> 01:28:14.940
Grandma Si!

718
01:28:16.190 --> 01:28:16.930
Khem...

719
01:28:18.180 --> 01:28:19.060
What's wrong?

720
01:28:28.500 --> 01:28:30.080
Grandma Si visited me in a dream.

721
01:28:34.220 --> 01:28:37.420
She didn't say anything, but...

722
01:28:40.380 --> 01:28:41.920
she handed me crystal orbs.

723
01:28:44.870 --> 01:28:45.860
Crystal orbs?

724
01:28:47.170 --> 01:28:47.820
Yes.

725
01:28:48.820 --> 01:28:50.030
They were crystal orbs,

726
01:28:50.430 --> 01:28:52.020
and there were two of them.

727
01:28:54.720 --> 01:28:56.070
When I saw them,

728
01:28:56.990 --> 01:28:58.260
they felt so familiar,

729
01:28:58.880 --> 01:29:00.350
but I couldn't tell what they were.

730
01:29:07.990 --> 01:29:10.450
Something wonderful is about to happen.

731
01:30:13.460 --> 01:30:14.750
Seeing the kids enjoy the food

732
01:30:15.110 --> 01:30:16.380
makes me so happy.

733
01:30:16.410 --> 01:30:17.970
Wouldn't it be even better

734
01:30:18.340 --> 01:30:20.610
if we had kids waiting for us at home?

735
01:30:20.640 --> 01:30:22.760
The little ones are looking so cool today.

736
01:30:22.950 --> 01:30:24.760
You're here to congratulate me, too, huh?

737
01:30:26.380 --> 01:30:29.890
We might not get to see each other as often

738
01:30:30.310 --> 01:30:33.630
and eventually go our own ways,

739
01:30:34.740 --> 01:30:36.730
but I want you to remember

740
01:30:37.510 --> 01:30:40.170
that I'll always be here for you.

741
01:30:41.260 --> 01:30:49.120
♪ Thought our love was strong, but now we're drifting apart, ♪

742
01:30:49.140 --> 01:30:55.830
♪ Now I'm on the edge, wondering if love still flickers in your heart ♪

743
01:30:55.860 --> 01:30:59.840
♪ The more you fade away, the more afraid I seem to be ♪

744
01:30:59.860 --> 01:31:03.850
♪ I fear you'll disappear from all the days ahead of me ♪

745
01:31:03.870 --> 01:31:07.900
♪ I'm scared of falling apart and losing you completely ♪

746
01:31:10.310 --> 01:31:15.270
♪ Without you, I don't know what I should do ♪

747
01:31:15.300 --> 01:31:19.280
♪ I need to know if you still love me too ♪

748
01:31:19.310 --> 01:31:23.820
♪ Just tell me that your love is still true ♪

749
01:31:23.840 --> 01:31:27.330
♪ And that you'll stay till our time is through ♪

750
01:31:27.350 --> 01:31:31.140
♪ Without you, it feels like my heart's gone astray ♪

751
01:31:31.150 --> 01:31:37.590
♪ Tell me the love we shared still means something today ♪

752
01:31:37.610 --> 01:31:41.300
♪ Please don't leave me drowning in tears this way ♪
